Speech models (downloaded separately, never inside the installer; see docs/MODELS.md):

- Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 by NVIDIA, licensed under CC BY 4.0
  (https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3). Used as converted to ONNX and quantised to int8
  by the sherpa-onnx project (https://huggingface.co/csukuangfj/sherpa-onnx-nemo-parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3-int8).
- WeSpeaker ResNet34-LM speaker embedding (wenet-e2e/wespeaker), trained on VoxCeleb, licensed under CC BY 4.0,
  as converted to ONNX by sherpa-onnx. Changed by Prism Transcribe: per-utterance mean subtraction added at the
  model's input (tools/add_mean_subtraction.py).
- Silero VAD, Copyright (c) 2020-present Silero Team, MIT licence.

Code built into the program:

- sherpa-onnx (Apache License 2.0) and ONNX Runtime (MIT), linked statically. vendor/sherpa-onnx carries one
  small change, described in vendor/PATCHES.md.
